<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>ระบบทุนการศึกษา - เข้าสู่ระบบ</title>

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style>
        :root {
            --swu-red: #dd1f28;
            --swu-red-hover: #b41720;
            --bg-gray: #f0f2f5;
            --text-dark: #333333;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-gray);
            font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .logo {
            width: 350px;
            display: block;
            margin: 30px auto 10px;
        }
        .title-text {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 500; /* แก้ไขจาก 425px เป็น 500 (Bold) */
            margin-top: 5px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        /* --- Login Card Layout --- */
        .login-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* --- Slider Adjustments --- */
        .carousel, .carousel-inner, .carousel-item {
            height: 100%;
        }

        .carousel-inner img {
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            width: 100%;
        }

        @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
            .carousel-inner img {
                height: 250px;
            }
            .login-card {
                margin-top: 20px;
                max-width: 450px;
            }
        }

        /* --- Form Styling --- */
        .form-container {
            padding: 40px;
        }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .form-container {
                padding: 50px;
            }
        }

        .btn-login {
            background-color: var(--swu-red);
            border: none;
            padding: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn-login:hover {
            background-color: var(--swu-red-hover);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(221, 31, 40, 0.3);
        }

        .form-control {
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-color: #e0e0e0;
        }
        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: var(--swu-red);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(221, 31, 40, 0.25);
        }
        .form-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <img src="/images/swu_logo.png" class="logo" alt="SWU Logo" 
         onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Srinakharinwirot_University_Logo.png/600px-Srinakharinwirot_University_Logo.png'" />

    <div class="title-text">เว็บไซต์ตรวจสอบข้อมูลการได้รับทุนการศึกษาของนิสิตนักศึกษา</div>

    <div class="login-card">
        <div class="row g-0">
            <div class="col-md-6 d-none d-md-block"> 
                <div id="scholarshipCarousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="carousel">
                    <div class="carousel-inner">
                        <div class="carousel-item active">
                            <img src="/images/bn_queen.jpg" alt="slide1" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x800/dd1f28/white?text=SWU+Scholarship'">
                        </div>
                        <div class="carousel-item">
                            <img src="/images/bn_swu1.png" alt="slide2" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x800/gray/white?text=SWU+Activity'">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#scholarshipCarousel" data-bs-slide="prev">
                        <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
                    </button>
                    <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#scholarshipCarousel" data-bs-slide="next">
                        <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="form-container">
                    <h3 class="text-center mb-4 fw-bold" style="color:var(--text-dark);">เข้าสู่ระบบ</h3>
                    
                    <% if (typeof message !== 'undefined' && message) { %>
                        <div class="alert alert-danger text-center py-2" role="alert" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
                            <%- message %>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>

                    <form action="/login" method="POST">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label">อีเมล</label>
                            <div class="input-group">
                                <span class="input-group-text bg-white text-muted"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i></span>
                                <input type="text" name="email" class="form-control" placeholder="กรอกอีเมล" required />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mb-4">
                            <label class="form-label">รหัสผ่าน</label>
                            <div class="input-group">
                                <span class="input-group-text bg-white text-muted"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i></span>
                                <input type="password" name="password" class="form-control" placeholder="กรอกรหัสผ่าน" required />
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-login w-100 text-white">เข้าสู่ระบบ</button>

                        <div class="text-center mt-4 d-flex justify-content-between font-monospace" style="font-size: 14px;">
                            <a href="/forgot" class="text-decoration-none text-secondary">ลืมรหัสผ่าน</a>
                            <a href="/register" class="text-decoration-underline fw-bold" style="color: var(--swu-red);">ลงทะเบียน</a>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


    <div class="footer">
        Copyright © Srinakharinwirot University<br>
        114 Sukhumvit 23, Bangkok 10110, Thailand. E-mail : contact@g.swu.ac.th
    </div>
</div>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>